        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:16px 28px 0 28px;"><img src="https://test.local/img/snap.jpg" alt="Chanel Classic Flap" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:504px;height:auto;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ece8de;"></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:16px 28px 0 28px;">
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;">Chanel Classic Flap</p>
          <p style="margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:18px;color:#1a1a1a;">$4,800<span style="color:#8a8378;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;">  (was $5,500)</span></p>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:16px 28px 0 28px;">
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;">Matched on brand, color, and size; price under your cap.</p>
          <p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#8a5a00;background:#fff7e6;border:1px solid #f3e3b8;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;">Newly listed in the last hour</p>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:16px 28px 0 28px;"><ul style="margin:0;padding:0 0 0 18px;font-size:13px;color:#4a4a4a;"><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">Watchlist: My Chanel Watchlist</li><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">Condition: Excellent</li><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">Color: Black</li><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">Source: Test Source</li></ul></td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:24px 28px 28px 28px;">
          <a href="https://bagscout.example.com/listings/99" style="display:inline-block;background:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;">View on BagScout</a>
          <a href="https://test.local/listing/snap-001" style="display:inline-block;margin-left:8px;color:#1a1a1a;text-decoration:underline;padding:12px 4px;font-size:14px;">View original listing</a>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="padding:0 28px 24px 28px;border-top:1px solid #ece8de;">
          <p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:11px;color:#8a8378;">You're receiving this because you have a BagScout watchlist for My Chanel Watchlist. Manage email preferences in your account settings.</p>
